    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1178">

                <pb facs="1195" n="1183" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg1183"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 PW/9–2644</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-09-26">September 26, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The British Ambassador<anchor n="65" xml:id="d1178-f1"/> called at his request
                    and left with me the attached copies of paraphrases of telegrams from the
                    Foreign Office relating to a Japanese peace feeler. I thanked him and said the
                    letter would receive appropriate attention.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d1178-a1.xml" xpointer="d1178-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d1178-a2.xml" xpointer="d1178-a2"/>
            </div>
